   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Rocket Man**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **In the Midnight Hour**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **You Never Can Tell**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **New Years Countdown**: back after 71 archived shows (1461 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **All Night Long**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Celebration**: back after 71 archived shows (1461 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Hungry Heart**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Rock The Casbah**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2012-12-31.dpa4023_24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 28 songs; 174 min [1]\n- **mmj2012-12-31.dpa4023_16bit**: source not stated; 28 songs; 174 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2012-12-31.dpa4023_24bit**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: DPA 4023>Lunatec V3>AD2K>Tascam HD-P2(24bit/48khz) [1]\n- **mmj2012-12-31.dpa4023_16bit**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: DPA 4023>Lunatec V3>AD2K>Tascam HD-P2(24bit/48khz) [2]. Also: Recorded via DPA 4023 mic, transferred to USB, processed on Macbook Pro, dithered to 16-bit [2]",
